cmu-nuke-xeno-detonation-one-minute = We are almost out of time, STOP THEM.
cmu-nuke-yautja-detonation-one-minute = You have approximately 60 seconds to abandon the hunting grounds before activation of the human purification device.
cmu-nuke-marine-detonation-ten-seconds = Nuclear detonation in ten seconds.
cmu-nuke-xeno-detonation-ten-seconds = STOP IT AT ALL COSTS!
cmu-nuke-marine-detonation-cancelled = Nuclear device activation has been disabled. The detonation countdown is cancelled.
cmu-nuke-xeno-detonation-cancelled = The tallhosts' hive killer countdown has been stopped.
cmu-nuke-xeno-sabotage-detonation-cancelled = The hive killer's activation has been stopped!
cmu-nuke-yautja-detonation-cancelled = The human purification device's signature has disappeared.
cmu-nuke-marine-detonated = Nuclear detonation confirmed. Ground-level structures are destroyed.
cmu-nuke-xeno-detonated = The human hive killer has detonated.
cmu-nuke-ground-level-only = The nuclear device can only be anchored, decrypted, and activated on the ground level.
cmu-nuke-must-be-anchored = Anchor the nuclear device before starting decryption.
cmu-nuke-comms-not-operational = Every communications tower must be repaired, anchored, and online before decryption can start.
cmu-nuke-not-ready = The nuclear device must be anchored on the ground and fully decrypted before activation.
cmu-nuke-access-denied = Access denied. Command access is required while command lockout is enabled.
cmu-nuke-controls-locked = The nuclear device controls are locked while decryption or detonation is active.
cmu-nuke-cant-anchor-here = The device must be on a ground-level grid to anchor.
cmu-nuke-safety-enabled = Disable the safety before starting decryption or activating the device.

